WEBVTT

00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:12.190
That's Regalo Island.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.200
Wow, that's awesome!

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:19.310
Starting today, you're part 
of the Arcana Famiglia.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:21.650
Yeah! And once I'm in the family,

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:23.620
I'm gonna be as strong as you, Dante!

00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:26.990
That won't be easy.

00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:28.540
I can do it!

00:00:28.780 --> 00:00:31.010
I'm gonna become strong, no matter what!

00:02:24.090 --> 00:02:26.740
Man, why are they only 
coming to you, Dante?

00:02:27.210 --> 00:02:30.180
Even the fish know who's stronger.

00:02:30.180 --> 00:02:33.130
That's why they keep floundering my way...

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:36.340
because they're fish.

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:34.150
Fish

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:44.980
So, how have you been since?

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:46.260
Since what?

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:48.590
You said you had a headache.

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:49.480
Oh, that.

00:02:50.080 --> 00:02:53.910
I don't know what it was, 
but after I slept, it got better.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:56.280
I haven't had one since.

00:02:56.850 --> 00:02:59.790
That's good to hear, 
but don't push yourself too hard.

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:01.200
Looking after your health is very—

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.590
I know!

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:04.180
Hey, Libertá!

00:03:04.180 --> 00:03:05.850
The lady is here!

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:07.450
Okay, I'll be right there!

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:11.080
I'll rest when I need to rest.

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:12.220
Okay?

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:18.590
Ms. Jovanna, huh?

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:22.340
Yes, she's a longtime friend of Mama.

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:25.790
<i>Jovanna gave me a lovely brooch,</i>

00:03:25.790 --> 00:03:28.590
<i>so I'd like you to give her this scarf.</i>

00:03:29.490 --> 00:03:31.280
<i>Would you, Felicitá?</i>

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:35.410
But I've never met her.

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:38.700
I think I've seen her 
two or three times.

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:42.820
Mama has exquisite taste, 
so I'm sure Ms. Jovanna will like it.

00:03:45.300 --> 00:03:46.240
But...

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:48.730
What the hell is up with this map?

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:50.700
If we keep taking all of these 
detours, the sun will go down.

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:53.670
Nova said he was too busy to go with us,

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.870
so he drew that for us, but...

00:03:57.050 --> 00:03:58.870
There's a faster way.

00:03:58.870 --> 00:03:59.550
What?

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:09.520
Come on, Princess, hurry up!

00:04:09.520 --> 00:04:11.010
O-Okay.

00:04:12.560 --> 00:04:14.850
This feels great!

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:17.600
It does, and it's such a great view.

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:22.320
It's the best when you can see 
both the city and the ocean.

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:29.030
But being on the ocean is the best.

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.120
The ocean?

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:36.130
Sailing across the ocean feels amazing.

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:40.520
When you're gazing at the endless 
ocean, nothing else matters.

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:44.720
There are no troubles, no boundaries.

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:47.390
You feel like you're truly free.

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:49.890
Well,

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:53.280
I got half of that from Dante.

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:57.940
The two of you get along so well.

00:04:57.940 --> 00:04:59.280
You're like father and son.

00:04:59.660 --> 00:05:02.030
Well, we've known each 
other for a long time.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.550
I don't have to put on airs around him.

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:06.830
How long have you known each other?

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:11.080
I'm not really sure...

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:15.830
Now that I think about it, 
I don't really remember.

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:17.950
Why can't I recall?

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:23.410
Whoops, we shouldn't 
be dawdling up here.

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:25.170
Let's go, Princess.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:28.350
Yes.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:37.440
<i>Am I forgetting something important?</i>

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:40.190
Libertá! In front of you!

00:05:50.170 --> 00:05:51.710
Ow...

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:55.000
Are you okay, Princess?

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:58.390
Yes, I think so.

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:02.070
Sorry!

00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:03.830
It's my fault for not paying attention.

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:05.420
No, it's fine.

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:09.010
It's not fine at all.

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:15.460
Come one, come all!

00:06:15.460 --> 00:06:16.930
Hey there, signorina!

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:19.030
We've got tons of great things!

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:20.770
Come on, Princess, speak up!

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.460
No one will come if you 
just stand there quietly!

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:23.690
Huh? Okay...

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:26.110
Welcome...

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:27.560
With a smile, come on!

00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:30.780
Welcome!

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:46.320
What in the world are they doing?

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:48.950
Thank you very much.

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:54.550
We really don't have 
time to be doing this.

00:06:55.780 --> 00:06:58.730
Pardon me, can I get this flower?

00:06:58.730 --> 00:06:59.730
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:02.140 --> 00:07:04.030
Oh, Ms. Jovanna!

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:06.940
Yes?

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:12.520
We're finally done.

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:13.780
I'm so tired.

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:16.120
Sorry, Princess.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:18.400
It's my fault we got 
into this weird mess.

00:07:18.400 --> 00:07:19.570
No, it's fine.

00:07:19.570 --> 00:07:22.040
Not to mention, we were able to 
give Ms. Jovanna her scarf.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:23.400
Yeah.

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:24.680
I guess if we'd gone to her house,

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:25.880
she wouldn't have been there.

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:28.800
It was only coincidence, 
but I'm glad we saw her.

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:32.720
Maybe it's part of your 
powers, Princess.

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:36.270
I can't really describe it,

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:39.820
but things seem to fall 
perfectly into place.

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:41.310
You really think so?

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:42.650
Yeah, I do.

00:07:43.300 --> 00:07:44.480
That has to be it.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:46.150
It's because of you, Princess.

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:51.350
Thanks to you two, 
my sales have doubled!

00:07:51.350 --> 00:07:53.910
You can take whatever 
you like as my thanks.

00:08:00.900 --> 00:08:02.020
A mask?

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:03.780
Yeah, I like them.

00:08:05.170 --> 00:08:07.630
I grew up in an orphanage.

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:11.260
That's where I met a huge masked man.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:14.640
I don't really remember it well,

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:18.010
but he's the one who took 
me out of the orphanage.

00:08:18.660 --> 00:08:20.140
He was really cool.

00:08:20.590 --> 00:08:22.060
So you've liked them since?

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:23.020
Yeah.

00:08:23.850 --> 00:08:25.520
When I'm looking at masks,

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:29.300
I feel like I can be strong 
and cool like that guy.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:33.490
What's wrong?

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:36.890
This mask... I've seen it before.

00:08:37.540 --> 00:08:39.870
You would find that rare item.

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:42.540
Is it expensive?

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:45.040
Yeah, it's from the Nord Country.

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:47.360
Apparently, a long time ago, 
there was an orphanage

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:49.170
there that did terrible 
things to children.

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:54.300
There's a tale that a hero wearing 
that mask saved the children.

00:08:57.900 --> 00:08:58.890
Dante!

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:01.150
Hey! At least knock.

00:09:01.150 --> 00:09:03.350
Sorry. But take a look at this!

00:09:03.660 --> 00:09:05.480
I really wanted you to see it, too!

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:07.190
Isn't it cool?

00:09:08.590 --> 00:09:11.000
I told you about when I 
was at the orphanage,

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.440
and a masked guy came 
to save me, right?

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:15.400
You think this might be the same mask?

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:18.820
Hey, what the heck?

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:21.320
I thought you'd like it...

00:09:22.070 --> 00:09:23.950
There was a report from Nova.

00:09:25.680 --> 00:09:27.620
I hear you fell from the roof.

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:31.060
How dare you put the lady 
in danger like that?

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:32.710
That was...

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:35.970
It's all because of that 
stupid map Nova drew...

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:36.930
Enough.

00:09:38.190 --> 00:09:39.890
Don't put the blame on others.

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:44.890
At this rate, you'll always be a child.

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:49.240
Put more effort into refining 
yourself and becoming stronger.

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:56.460
Good grief.

00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:58.360
Such beautiful love between 
the teacher and student.

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:01.920
Jolly.

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:08.630
I'm terribly sorry you had 
to see that, Milady.

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:21.890
Was there something else?

00:10:22.310 --> 00:10:23.420
No.

00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:28.310
Apparently, she saw into your heart.

00:10:28.640 --> 00:10:29.640
Impossible.

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:33.020
Milady is still growing,

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:36.150
just like your student.

00:10:42.350 --> 00:10:46.000
The new dolce from that 
place is really good!

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:49.120
The strawberry and custard 
cream is delicious!

00:10:49.560 --> 00:10:51.960
You should definitely try it when 
you have a chance, milady.

00:10:55.950 --> 00:10:58.010
Is something the matter, milady?

00:10:58.390 --> 00:11:02.480
Huh? Oh, it's nothing...

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:04.140
I'm sorry for making you worry.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:07.600
We're always here for you, milady!

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:09.770
It must be hard in a man's world...

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:11.670
But we're here if you need to talk.

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:14.050
Uh... thanks.

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:25.530
Hey!

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:26.870
Princess!

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:36.800
It's not because Dante said it.

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:40.490
But I made the decision 
to live by the sword.

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:43.360
So I thought I need to be stronger.

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:45.890
I see.

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:48.600
Not to mention,

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:51.980
I thought I might be able to 
remember if I became stronger.

00:11:54.940 --> 00:11:57.400
Remember the guy in the mask 
and more about my past.

00:11:57.850 --> 00:11:58.990
And other things.

00:12:03.770 --> 00:12:05.780
You don't need to worry.

00:12:06.140 --> 00:12:08.410
I'll become stronger and win the Duello.

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:10.310
All right?

00:12:14.090 --> 00:12:15.840
Unfortunately,

00:12:15.840 --> 00:12:21.140
there's nothing I know about 
Libertá and Dante's past.

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:22.220
I see...

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:26.470
Even if I did know, 
that's between the two of them.

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:28.350
It's not our place to interfere.

00:12:28.730 --> 00:12:30.860
I know that, but...

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:35.700
Sir Nova, it is time for the patrol.

00:12:35.700 --> 00:12:37.650
Understood. I'll be right there.

00:12:42.890 --> 00:12:44.290
If you're that concerned,

00:12:46.480 --> 00:12:48.240
you should ask him yourself.

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:03.280
Hey there, Fukulota.

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:04.180
What brings you here?

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:09.300
You're not exactly a 
messenger pigeon...

00:13:21.680 --> 00:13:24.790
It appears I've underestimated 
your powers, Milady.

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:27.060
I'm sorry.

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:28.840
I didn't mean to read your heart.

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:32.540
But I was worried about Libertá,

00:13:33.230 --> 00:13:35.950
and wanted to do whatever 
I could to help...

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:39.370
Thank you, Milady.

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:46.380
What the hell?

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:49.670
Oh, if it isn't Libertá.

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:55.120
What the hell is with the long face?

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:56.520
Perfect timing.

00:13:56.900 --> 00:13:58.780
You should come with us, Libertá.

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:04.530
Thank you for the meal!

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:08.770
Seconds, please!

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:10.780
Come on now.

00:14:11.150 --> 00:14:15.470
If you don't hurry up and eat, 
Pace's gonna eat it all, brat.

00:14:16.030 --> 00:14:18.320
I'm gonna eat, and I'm not a brat!

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:24.380
You should eat a lot 
and feel better soon.

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:27.540
I'm fine to begin with.

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:29.390
If that's the case, good.

00:14:29.710 --> 00:14:32.280
You know what will happen

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:35.170
if Milady happened to become sad

00:14:35.170 --> 00:14:37.380
looking at your dreary face, right?

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:39.480
Seconds, please!

00:14:39.830 --> 00:14:40.770
F-Fire!

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.230
There's a fire!

00:14:43.010 --> 00:14:46.440
I met Libertá ten years ago,

00:14:46.920 --> 00:14:48.280
in the Nord Country.

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:54.990
Casa Bianca.

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:02.840
From the outside, it looked 
like a normal orphanage.

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:03.990
But behind the facade,

00:15:03.990 --> 00:15:06.270
they were conducting various 
experiments on those children.

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:09.020
And apparently, since 
Libertá had powers,

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:12.720
the way they treated him 
was even more inhuman.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:22.440
Bring water!

00:15:26.430 --> 00:15:28.110
This way!

00:15:28.480 --> 00:15:30.360
We have to hurry and put out the fire!

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.570
I'm back!

00:15:32.040 --> 00:15:34.940
Good! Now we can... Libertá!

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:41.210
<i>Who the hell are you?!</i>

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:56.680
<i>D-Don't move!</i>

00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:59.090
<i>Don't you dare move!</i>

00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:09.280
<i>Burn.</i>

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:16.240
Libertá's Arcana Power is 
the power of the word.

00:16:17.730 --> 00:16:19.080
Power of the word?

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:22.710
If he wishes something to 
break, it will break.

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:27.000
If he wishes something to 
disappear, it can disappear.

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:29.670
Does Libertá know about this?

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:32.860
There's no reason he would know.

00:16:32.860 --> 00:16:33.510
What?!

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:36.970
Hey! Why are you just standing...

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:56.570
<i>Are you here to study me, too?</i>

00:16:56.920 --> 00:17:00.410
<i>No, I came here to save you.</i>

00:17:02.020 --> 00:17:03.830
<i>Save... me?</i>

00:17:06.100 --> 00:17:08.570
<i>Want to come with me, kid?</i>

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:17.760
How the hell did I forget 
something so important?

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:22.560
As soon as Libertá was 
away from the orphanage,

00:17:23.110 --> 00:17:24.840
he gradually became happier,

00:17:24.840 --> 00:17:27.520
and was able to interact 
with those on the ship.

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:29.870
But at times,

00:17:29.870 --> 00:17:31.650
the wounds on his heart would cause

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:33.350
him to lose control of his powers,

00:17:33.350 --> 00:17:34.450
and he would go berserk.

00:17:35.270 --> 00:17:38.360
I used my Arcana Power to 
seal away his memories,

00:17:38.360 --> 00:17:40.810
and Mondo himself sealed 
away his Power.

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:42.090
But why...

00:17:42.650 --> 00:17:45.880
If he doesn't grow up 
and become stronger,

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:47.980
I will not undo the seal.

00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:54.610
Please keep this a secret 
from Libertá, Milady.

00:17:58.420 --> 00:18:01.320
Oh, hey, Princess, I wanted to see you.

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:07.350
I remember now, about the 
time I met the masked man.

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:12.190
But bits and pieces are still blurry.

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:16.150
So I have a request.

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:19.410
Just this once...

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:21.780
Could you read my heart?

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:27.280
You might be able to see the 
parts that I can't remember.

00:18:28.740 --> 00:18:30.330
But...

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:31.290
Please!

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:34.360
I can't...

00:18:42.300 --> 00:18:43.400
Felicitá?

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:45.860
I wonder why...

00:18:48.180 --> 00:18:50.320
we even have these Arcana Powers.

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:05.800
I have something I want to ask you.

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:07.440
What is it?

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:11.330
The masked man, it was you, wasn't it?!

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:16.170
Did Milady tell you?

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:20.260
So she knew, as well.

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:23.370
I'm the only one who didn't know.

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:27.340
Why did you erase my memories?!

00:19:28.070 --> 00:19:30.650
Because I can't control my powers?!

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:33.240
You thought I would lose control again?

00:19:33.240 --> 00:19:34.690
Is that it?!

00:19:37.930 --> 00:19:42.250
I don't think you've 
become strong enough

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.600
to be able to accept your past.

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:47.440
Am I mistaken?

00:19:51.240 --> 00:19:53.080
Don't decide for me.

00:20:22.840 --> 00:20:24.330
Ow!

00:20:24.330 --> 00:20:26.310
What the hell, Chickpea?!

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:29.890
Well, at least you're well 
enough to call people names.

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:31.680
I'm always fine!

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:33.340
Is that so?

00:20:33.340 --> 00:20:34.620
Good to hear.

00:20:35.890 --> 00:20:38.000
Felicitá was worried sick, you know.

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:43.560
I thought you were going to become

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:45.300
stronger for Felicitá's sake?

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:48.640
So become stronger.

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:53.260
Then no one will have anything 
to complain about.

00:20:55.120 --> 00:20:56.650
The hell is this, a hit-and-run?

00:21:00.970 --> 00:21:02.460
Become stronger,

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:04.820
huh?

00:22:37.560 --> 00:22:39.790
Now, let us choose the one 
who should be punished

00:22:39.790 --> 00:22:41.210
by naming their card.

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:43.200
La Luna.

00:22:43.200 --> 00:22:44.920
L'Imperatore.

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:47.420
Two against one, L'Imperatore.

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:50.950
Tonight's sinner is you, Dante.

00:22:52.860 --> 00:22:55.160
You still have a lot to learn

00:22:55.160 --> 00:22:58.370
if you're allowing Milady 
to read your heart.

00:22:59.670 --> 00:23:01.710
And so, Felicitá, please try

00:23:01.710 --> 00:23:04.360
to read Dante's heart one more time.

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:09.080
Do you think you can 
read my true thoughts?

00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:10.820
Let us battle, Milady!

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:30.260
Just kidding!

00:23:31.170 --> 00:23:34.130
Nova, I want you to become 
a bigger person.

00:23:34.130 --> 00:23:35.350
Yes, Mama!

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:39.070
That is why I drink milk every day!

00:23:39.070 --> 00:23:40.230
Nova...
